+The moment a step's verification passes, edit the plan file to flip that
+step's leading `- [ ]` to `- [x]` — that exact line, nothing around it
+reformatted — and let the edit ride along with the step's commit. One flip
+per verified step, never batched at the end: this is what a later session
+resumes from. A step that is only partly done stays `- [ ]`, and a step
+whose verification regresses later flips back.
